                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " naam, asema hivi, Ni neno dogo sana wewe kuwa mtumishi wangu ili kuyainua makabila ya Yakobo, na kuwarejesha watu wa Israeli waliohifadhiwa; zaidi ya hayo nitakutoa uwe nuru ya mataifa, upate kuwa wokovu wangu hata miisho ya dunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
